"der Aufbewahrungsfrist wird sie automatisch anonymisiert; Statistik-"
"Aggregate bleiben erhalten."
msgstr ""
"Upon approval, the person is moved to the trash. After the retention period "
"expires they are automatically anonymized; statistical aggregates are "
